\[E_{C}\frac{d\sigma^{\uparrow}}{d^{3}\vec{p}_{C}}-E_{C}\frac{d \sigma^{\downarrow}}{d^{3}\vec{p}_{C}} = \sum_{a,b,c,d}\int dx_{a}dx_{b}dzd^{2}\vec{k}_{\perp C}h_{1a/A} \left(x_{a},Q^{2}\right)f_{b/B}\left(x_{b},Q^{2}\right) \tag{1.13}\] \[\times\frac{d\hat{\sigma}^{ab\to cd}}{d\hat{t}}\frac{\hat{s}}{ \pi z^{2}}\delta\left(\hat{s}+\hat{t}+\hat{u}\right)\tilde{\Delta}\hat{D}_{C/c }\left(z,k_{\perp C},Q^{2}\right).\]

